# The cassette key is a hash of the canonical request, so line endings cannot
# change it. The file digests a reader might take of a cassette are a different
# matter, and a checkout that silently rewrote CRLF would make those differ by
# platform. Everything textual is LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mp3 binary
